<title>UK: M Stanley set calls on &quot;competitive edge' basket.</title>
<headline>M Stanley set calls on &quot;competitive edge' basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) has issued 20 million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on a basket of firms, lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International and Morgan Stanley Bank said.</p>
<p>The basket includes ABB B, Sandvik B,</p>
<p>British Airways, British Petroleum, Unilever Plc,</p>
<p>Hoechst, SGS Thompson and Technip.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   12.DEC.96		LISTING    LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    1000		     SPOT REF   1000 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	 MATURITY     STRIKE    ISSUE     PREMIUM  GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	 13.NOV.98    1000 DEM  9.50 DEM  9.50 PCT 10.5 X</p>
<p> CALL	 13.NOV.98    1100 DEM  5.40 DEM  15.4 PCT 12.70 X</p>
<p> CALL	 12.NOV.99    1000 DEM  12.70 DEM 12.7 PCT 7.9 X</p>
<p> CALL	 12.NOV.99    1150 DEM  6.80 DEM  21.8 PCT 14.7 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
